Het SB-het
"Heterogeneous store-buffering: P0 on the CPU (AArch64), P1 on the GPU (LISA/PTX)"
{
0:X1=x;
0:X2=y;
}
 P0:cpu      | P1:gpu              ;
 MOV W0,#1   | w[release,sys] y 1  ;
 STR W0,[X1] | r[acquire,sys] r0 x ;
 LDR W3,[X2] |                     ;
scopes: (sys (gpu (cta P1)))
exists (0:X3=0 /\ 1:r0=0)
